msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Could not find the <command>%1</command> program on your system. Please "
"install it if necessary, and ensure that it can be found using the "
"environment variable <envar>PATH</envar>."
msgstr ""
"No s'ha pogut trobar el programa <command>%1</command> en el sistema. "
"Instal·leu-lo si fos necessari, assegureu-vos que es pot trobar usant la "
"variable d'entorn <envar>PATH</envar>."

